        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >One bot. Endless waves. Just one rule: never stop moving.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into <strong>Bot Rush</strong>, a fast-paced arcade shooter where you control a small round robot facing relentless waves of enemies charging in straight lines. Your goal? Wipe them out, upgrade your abilities, and survive long enough to beat the level—or die trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple, addictive gameplay</strong><br>Enemies come straight at you. You dodge, shoot, and fight to stay alive. Easy to pick up, hard to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic upgrades and passives</strong><br>Every milestone gives you a choice of powerful passive boosts. Build unique combinations with every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-stop action and power scaling</strong><br>The longer you survive, the stronger the enemies—and the more powerful you become. Every second counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Futuristic setting with a Japanese urban flair</strong><br>Battle through stylized city streets inspired by neon-lit Asian metropolises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode for high-score chasers</strong><br>No limit, no mercy. See how long you can last when the waves never end.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Easy to learn, impossible to put down</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bot Rush</strong> delivers quick, intense sessions perfect for short bursts or extended play. Whether you have five minutes or an hour, you're always one click away from full-on action and satisfying progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you're down soldier, just keep up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >One bot. Endless waves. Just one rule: never stop moving.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into <strong>Bot Rush</strong>, a fast-paced arcade shooter where you control a small round robot facing relentless waves of enemies charging in straight lines. Your goal? Wipe them out, upgrade your abilities, and survive long enough to beat the level—or die trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple, addictive gameplay</strong><br>Enemies come straight at you. You dodge, shoot, and fight to stay alive. Easy to pick up, hard to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic upgrades and passives</strong><br>Every milestone gives you a choice of powerful passive boosts. Build unique combinations with every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-stop action and power scaling</strong><br>The longer you survive, the stronger the enemies—and the more powerful you become. Every second counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Futuristic setting with a Japanese urban flair</strong><br>Battle through stylized city streets inspired by neon-lit Asian metropolises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode for high-score chasers</strong><br>No limit, no mercy. See how long you can last when the waves never end.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Easy to learn, impossible to put down</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bot Rush</strong> delivers quick, intense sessions perfect for short bursts or extended play. Whether you have five minutes or an hour, you're always one click away from full-on action and satisfying progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you're down soldier, just keep up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
